    "value": "1. Given I am on the EU or EU International storefront, when I open the Details & Care slide-out for a sunglasses product that has a DoC PDF associated, then a link to the Declaration of Conformity PDF is displayed within that tab.\n2. Given I click the Declaration of Conformity link, when the action is confirmed, then the PDF opens in a new tab or as a download (TBC with design).\n3. Given a sunglasses product has no DoC PDF associated, when I open the Details & Care slide-out, then no link is displayed.\n4. Given I am on any storefront other than EU or EU International, when I open the Details & Care slide-out, then the Declaration of Conformity link is not displayed regardless of whether a PDF exists.\n5. Given a non-sunglasses product, when I open the Details & Care slide-out on EU or EU International, then the Declaration of Conformity link is not displayed."
