          "to_string": "How is the PDF stored and associated to a product — via a product attribute in BM, a DAM, or another asset management system? This determines whether a separate BM configuration story is needed.\n\nConfirm with design on PDF display in Details & Care, discuss whether the PDF opens in a new tab or downloads directly.\n\nThis requirement is currently being implemented on the existing site — confirm whether the approach taken there should be mirrored on the new site.",
